{"tool_name":"sciview","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>SciView is an ImageJ/FIJI plugin for 3D visualization of images and meshes. It uses the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/ClearVolume/scenery\">Scenery</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"http://clearvolume.github.io/\">ClearVolume</a>&nbsp;infrastructure. SciView integrates&nbsp;<a href=\"https://imagej.net/ImageJ2\">ImageJ2</a>&nbsp;functionality, including&nbsp;<a href=\"https://imagej.net/ImageJ_Ops\">ImageJ Ops</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://imagej.net/index.php?title=ImageJ_Mesh&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\">ImageJ Mesh</a>, to provide the ability to interact with image and mesh data in 3D and interface with the popular&nbsp;<a href=\"https://imagej.net/Fiji\">Fiji</a>&nbsp;software ecosystem.</p>\n\n<p>An update site is available:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://sites.imagej.net/SciView/\">http://sites.imagej.net/SciView/</a></p>","summary":"","value":"<p>SciView is an ImageJ/FIJI plugin for 3D visualization of images and meshes. It uses the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/ClearVolume/scenery\">Scenery</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"http://clearvolume.github.io/\">ClearVolume</a>&nbsp;infrastructure. SciView integrates&nbsp;<a href=\"https://imagej.net/ImageJ2\">ImageJ2</a>&nbsp;functionality, including&nbsp;<a href=\"https://imagej.net/ImageJ_Ops\">ImageJ Ops</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://imagej.net/index.php?title=ImageJ_Mesh&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\">ImageJ Mesh</a>, to provide the ability to interact with image and mesh data in 3D and interface with the popular&nbsp;<a href=\"https://imagej.net/Fiji\">Fiji</a>&nbsp;software ecosystem.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>An update site is available:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://sites.imagej.net/SciView/\">http://sites.imagej.net/SciView/</a></p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-10-15T08:40:11+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-12-09T18:08:09+00:00"}],"default_la